---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Bi from '../../components/Bi.astro';

const internships = [
  {
    date: '2026.01.19 - Present',
    roleZh: '算法实习生',
    roleEn: 'Algorithm Intern',
    orgZh: '可灵 · 快手 (Kling, Kuaishou)',
    orgEn: 'Kling AI, Kuaishou',
    orgUrl: 'https://klingai.com/',
    logo: '/images/orgs/kling.png',
    summaryZh: '主导多模态大模型 Agent 及其推理、数据与训练栈，研发 ManyWorlds 机器人数据引擎，提出长视频记忆方法 MemStrata 并以第一作者发布评测 VMem-Bench；工作覆盖大模型 Agent、具身智能与视觉生成。',
    summaryEn: 'Lead a multimodal LLM agent together with its serving, data and training stack, built the ManyWorlds robot data engine, and developed the long-video memory method MemStrata with its first-authored benchmark VMem-Bench—spanning LLM agents, embodied AI and visual generation.',
    projects: [
      {
        titleZh: "多模态大模型 Agent 与训练基础设施",
        titleEn: "Multimodal LLM agents & training infrastructure",
        dateZh: "2026.09 – 至今",
        dateEn: "2026.09 – present",
        items: [
          { labelZh: "问题", labelEn: "Problem", zh: "让通用多模态大模型不经机器人专用训练，就能通过工具调用持续对话、按目标完成物理任务。", en: "Let general multimodal LLMs, without robot-specific training, hold an ongoing conversation and pursue physical goals through tool calls." },
          { labelZh: "Agent 框架", labelEn: "Agent harness", zh: "主导 Harness 设计：单一物理动作工具 + 只读运动规划的工具协议、动作前预测与实测反馈、长上下文压缩与可续跑、全程可重放的 Trace；并将 GR00T、RLDX-1 等 VLA 模型接入为可调用技能。", en: "Led the harness design: a tool protocol with a single physical-action tool plus read-only motion planning, pre-action prediction with measured feedback, long-context compaction with resumable runs, and fully replayable traces; integrated VLA models such as GR00T and RLDX-1 as callable skills." },
          { labelZh: "推理部署", labelEn: "Serving", zh: "用 vLLM 部署 DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash（B200 · TP=4 · <strong>1M 上下文</strong>）与 Qwen3.8-27B（A800 · TP=2），打通原生工具调用，在 RoboTwin 仿真中跑通多步闭环交互。", en: "Served DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash (B200 · TP=4 · <strong>1M context</strong>) and Qwen3.8-27B (A800 · TP=2) with vLLM using native tool calling, and ran multi-step closed-loop episodes in RoboTwin." },
          { labelZh: "训练数据", labelEn: "Training data", zh: "搭建“交互轨迹 → SFT 样本”数据管线，生成 <strong>20,590</strong> 条交互轨迹，其中 8,503 条通过在线推理输入与训练样本的一致性校验。", en: "Built a trajectory-to-SFT data pipeline that produced <strong>20,590</strong> interaction trajectories, 8,503 of which pass consistency checks between online inference inputs and training samples." },
          { labelZh: "训练栈", labelEn: "Training stack", zh: "主导搭建面向 <strong>48×B200</strong> 的 TorchTitan 分布式训练栈，支持 27.8B 参数多模态模型的 LoRA / 全参 × 视觉编码器冻结 / 可训四种模式，已通过环境自检与参数审核。", en: "Led a TorchTitan distributed training stack targeting <strong>48×B200</strong> for a 27.8B-parameter multimodal model, covering four modes (LoRA / full × frozen / trainable vision encoder); it passes environment self-checks and parameter audits." },
          { labelZh: "成长", labelEn: "Growth", zh: "从视觉生成转向大模型 Agent，补齐了大模型推理部署（vLLM、百万上下文、原生工具调用）与多机分布式训练的工程能力；体会到 Agent 的能力上限更多取决于工具协议设计和可重放、可校验的数据闭环，而不是单次提示词。", en: "Moved from visual generation to LLM agents, adding hands-on skills in LLM serving (vLLM, million-token context, native tool calling) and multi-node distributed training; learned that an agent's ceiling depends more on tool-protocol design and a replayable, verifiable data loop than on any single prompt." },
        ],
      },
      {
        titleZh: "ManyWorlds · 机器人数据引擎",
        titleEn: "ManyWorlds · robot data engine",
        dateZh: "2026.08 – 2026.11",
        dateEn: "2026.08 – 2026.11",
        items: [
          { labelZh: "问题", labelEn: "Problem", zh: "机器人示范数据采集昂贵，视觉多样性不足。", en: "Robot demonstrations are expensive to collect and visually narrow." },
          { labelZh: "方案", labelEn: "Approach", zh: "主导研发 ManyWorlds：用冻结的通用视频生成模型（不做机器人专用微调）把一条示范改写到新的场景、光照、材质、干扰物、机器人外观或被操作物体中，原始动作直接复用为标签；每个候选都与源视频逐项比对，只有<strong>动作兼容且编辑完成</strong>才发布，否则换种子重试或丢弃。", en: "Led ManyWorlds, which re-renders a demonstration into new scenes, lighting, materials, distractors, robot appearances or manipulated objects with a frozen general-purpose video model (no robot-specific fine-tuning) and reuses the recorded actions as labels. Every candidate is compared with its source and released only if it is <strong>action compatible and edit complete</strong>; otherwise it is retried with a new seed or discarded." },
          { labelZh: "管线", labelEn: "Pipeline", zh: "四个模块：① <em>Evidence Extractor</em> 从源视频提取机器人关键点与掩码、被操作物体与接触信息（有标定或仿真状态时直接投影，否则用 SAM 3.1 分割、CoWTracker 跟踪），每个信号都带可见性与适用性标记；② <em>Proposer</em> 从 180 条人工审核的编辑文本（5 个外观族 × 3 档强度，可两三族组合）出请求，只描述源相机里看得见的机器人结构，以免生成器画出多余的机械臂，其中 30% 由 Qwen3.8-27B 按画面改写，物体替换按源单独规划为可抓取的替代物；③ <em>Generator</em> 为冻结的四步蒸馏 MiniMax-H3，只输入源 RGB 视频与编辑文本，动作绕过生成；④ <em>Verifier</em> 逐项与源比对，发布的视频–动作对保留源 ID、编辑请求、通过的尝试序号和各项分数。", en: "Four modules: (1) the <em>Evidence Extractor</em> records robot keypoints and masks, the manipulated object and contacts from the source (projected from calibration or simulator state when available, otherwise SAM 3.1 segmentation and CoWTracker tracking), each tagged with visibility and applicability; (2) the <em>Proposer</em> draws requests from 180 audited edit texts (5 appearance families × 3 strengths, composable), describes only the robot structure visible in the source camera so the generator does not draw extra arms, has Qwen3.8-27B rewrite 30% of them for the visible scene, and plans grasp-compatible object swaps per source; (3) the <em>Generator</em> is a frozen four-step distilled MiniMax-H3 that sees only the source RGB video and the edit text, while the actions bypass generation; (4) the <em>Verifier</em> compares each candidate with its source, and every released pair keeps its source id, request, passing attempt and check scores." },
          { labelZh: "质检", labelEn: "Checks", zh: "动作兼容：相机位姿（SIFT / ECC，偏移 ≤ 0.10）、机器人运动（CoWTracker 在两段视频中跟踪同一批关键点，对称 PCK ≥ 0.67）、物体轨迹（SAM 2.1 以源掩码为种子跟踪，误差 ≤ 0.30）、凭空多出的机器人部件与“任务开局已完成”（Qwen3.8-27B 并排比较）、时序稳定（RAFT 光流 warp 误差）和曝光；编辑完成：Qwen3-VL-32B 对照编辑问题判断（p ≥ 0.5，物体替换 0.93）。缺失的证据一律不算通过。", en: "Action compatibility: camera pose (SIFT / ECC, shift ≤ 0.10), robot motion (the same CoWTracker keypoints tracked in both videos, symmetric PCK ≥ 0.67), object path (SAM 2.1 seeded with the source mask, error ≤ 0.30), spurious robot parts and an already-progressed start (side-by-side Qwen3.8-27B queries), temporal stability (RAFT warp error) and exposure. Edit completion: Qwen3-VL-32B against the planned edit question (p ≥ 0.5; 0.93 for object swaps). Missing evidence never counts as a pass." },
          { labelZh: "阈值", labelEn: "Thresholds", zh: "先在已知答案的参考视频上定初值（只改外观的回放必须通过；末端偏移、时间扭曲、错误源视频、相机扰动必须被拒）；再在开发审计集上按事先登记的候选与阈值网格，做 12 个数据集合的留一交叉验证，只保留在两个模型评审下都降低误放行的改动；冻结后在与所有已用标注按源轨迹不重叠的新样本上只测一次。相机与物体阈值有意放松、只拦明显错误；动作阈值的 bootstrap 区间为 0.48–0.72，对应 69%–77% 的放行率。", en: "Bars are first set on known-answer reference videos (appearance-only replays must pass; end-effector offsets, time warps, wrong sources and camera perturbations must fail). Changes and their grids were then registered on a development audit, chosen by leave-one-collection-out validation over 12 collections, and kept only if they lowered false accepts under both model judges; the frozen rule was tested once on fresh samples disjoint by source trajectory. Camera and object bars are deliberately loose and catch only gross failures; the motion bar's bootstrap range (0.48–0.72) corresponds to 69%–77% release." },
          { labelZh: "生成器", labelEn: "Generator choice", zh: "生成器也由 Verifier 来选：四个系统渲染同样 200 个 RoboCasa 单元，看起来最像真实视频的 RoboTransfer 只通过 13.0%，MiniMax-H3 通过 <strong>63.0%</strong>——“看起来真”和“能用”的排序正好相反；以源视频为条件通过 71.1%，只给机器人渲染仅 2.8%；四步蒸馏版通过率不降，每 GPU 小时产出 8.0 条（原 1.1 条）。", en: "The Verifier also chooses the generator: on the same 200 RoboCasa units, the most realistic-looking RoboTransfer passes only 13.0% while MiniMax-H3 passes <strong>63.0%</strong>, so looking real and being usable rank the systems in opposite order. Conditioning on the source video passes 71.1% versus 2.8% for a robot-only rendering, and the four-step distilled model keeps the pass rate while releasing 8.0 instead of 1.1 clips per GPU-hour." },
          { labelZh: "规模", labelEn: "Scale", zh: "从 25 种机器人本体的 6,414 条源轨迹扩充出 <strong>80,894</strong> 条视频–动作对（约 162 小时）：141,525 次生成尝试，放行率 62.6%，生成与质检共约 4,509 B200 GPU 小时。", en: "Expanded 6,414 source trajectories from 25 robot embodiments into <strong>80,894</strong> video–action pairs (~162 h): 141,525 attempts, a 62.6% release rate, and about 4,509 B200 GPU-hours for generation and verification." },
          { labelZh: "效果", labelEn: "Results", zh: "人工审核下动作不兼容率由 23.9% 降至 <strong>3.3%</strong>。同一候选池中，只用被拒 / 均匀抽样 / 通过验证的候选训练 Diffusion Policy，Clean 成功率为 37.5 / 41.5 / <strong>56.5</strong>（被拒数据比不加增强还差）；在 4 个 RoboTwin 2.0 任务的 6 个测试设置上，平均成功率为仅源数据 15.6、2D 增强 29.8、未验证 29.2、验证后 <strong>38.3</strong>。", en: "Human audit shows action incompatibility falling from 23.9% to <strong>3.3%</strong>. From one candidate pool, Diffusion Policy trained on rejected / uniformly sampled / verified candidates reaches 37.5 / 41.5 / <strong>56.5</strong> on Clean (rejected data is worse than no augmentation); averaged over six test settings of four RoboTwin 2.0 tasks, success is 15.6 (source only), 29.8 (2D augmentation), 29.2 (unverified) and <strong>38.3</strong> (verified)." },
          { labelZh: "真机", labelEn: "Real robot", zh: "搭建 Franka FR3 真机部署链路（双相机观测 → 远程推理 → 机械臂执行），在两项任务、三种策略（π0.5、Diffusion Policy、Fast-WAM）上测试，每格 60 次：新光照 / 干扰物 / 新背景下，验证数据为 <strong>48.3 / 45.0 / 41.7%</strong>，未过滤数据为 38.3 / 35.0 / 33.3%，仅源数据为 23.3 / 18.3 / 10.0%。", en: "Built a Franka FR3 deployment path (dual-camera observation → remote inference → arm execution) and tested two tasks with three policies (π0.5, Diffusion Policy, Fast-WAM), 60 trials per cell: under new lighting / distractors / background, verified data reach <strong>48.3 / 45.0 / 41.7%</strong>, against 38.3 / 35.0 / 33.3% for unfiltered and 23.3 / 18.3 / 10.0% for source-only data." },
          { labelZh: "成长", labelEn: "Growth", zh: "认识到生成数据能不能用，靠看画面判断不了：画面最逼真的生成器通过率最低，被拒样本训出的策略还不如只用源数据，所以每条数据都要拿源视频逐项核对；学会先定好规则和留出集、再在新数据上只测一次，而不是看着测试结果调阈值；也第一次独立完成了从生成数据、训练策略到真机部署评测的全过程。", en: "Learned that whether generated data is usable cannot be judged by eye: the most realistic-looking generator had the lowest pass rate, and policies trained on rejected samples did worse than source-only ones, so every pair has to be checked against its source. Learned to fix rules and held-out sets before testing once on fresh data, instead of tuning thresholds on test results. Also carried a project end to end for the first time, from generated data and policy training to real-robot deployment and evaluation." },
        ],
      },
      {
        titleZh: "长视频生成与视觉记忆",
        titleEn: "Long-video generation & visual memory",
        dateZh: "2026.01 – 2026.08",
        dateEn: "2026.01 – 2026.08",
        items: [
          { labelZh: "问题", labelEn: "Problem", zh: "长视频需要跨段保持角色、道具与世界状态一致，而生成器每次只能看到有限的上下文：历史该压成什么形式、每段该记住什么、什么时候该忘掉，是这八个月始终围绕的问题。", en: "Long videos must keep characters, props and world state consistent across segments, while a generator sees only a bounded context each time. What form history should take, what each segment should remember, and when to forget were the questions behind these eight months." },
          { labelZh: "2026.01–03 · 起步", labelEn: "2026.01–03 · Groundwork", zh: "复现与调研 Wan 2.1、LTX-2 等开源视频生成模型；探索前馈式动态 3D 高斯重建（F3GS，在 Depth Anything 3 上接时变高斯预测头）与多视角主体 tokenizer；在 Wan 2.1 上搭建 flow-matching 微调栈，支持全参、LoRA 与 prefix 三种训练方式。", en: "Reproduced and surveyed open video generators such as Wan 2.1 and LTX-2; explored feed-forward dynamic 3D Gaussian reconstruction (F3GS, a time-varying Gaussian head on Depth Anything 3) and a multi-view subject tokenizer; built a flow-matching fine-tuning stack for Wan 2.1 supporting full, LoRA and prefix training." },
          { labelZh: "2026.03–04 · 生成器内记忆", labelEn: "2026.03–04 · In-generator memory", zh: "在 Wan 2.1 T2V（1.3B / 14B）上设计记忆模块：把历史视频 latent 多尺度压成少量记忆 token 作为条件注入（外置记忆），或映射为按槽位分配的动态 LoRA 权重写入 DiT（参数化记忆），迭代 5 个版本。", en: "Designed memory modules for Wan 2.1 T2V (1.3B / 14B): history latents are compressed at multiple scales into a few memory tokens injected as conditions (external memory), or mapped to slot-assigned dynamic LoRA weights written into the DiT (parametric memory); iterated over five versions." },
          { labelZh: "2026.04 · HSPC tokenizer", labelEn: "2026.04 · HSPC tokenizer", zh: "提出超球面路径约束（HSPC）：把视觉内容编码为单位超球面上两个对跖锚点之间的分层中点路径，以角度误差剪枝实现可变长 token，并在其上训练文本条件的自回归下一帧预测。", en: "Proposed hyperspherical path constraints (HSPC): visual content is encoded as a hierarchical midpoint path between two antipodal anchors on the unit hypersphere, angle-error pruning yields variable-length tokens, and a text-conditioned autoregressive next-frame predictor is trained on top." },
          { labelZh: "2026.05–06 · 统一视觉表征", labelEn: "2026.05–06 · Unified visual representation", zh: "转向连续表征：在冻结的 Wan VAE latent 上训练池化编码器 / 反池化解码器，并对齐冻结的 DINOv3 语义特征；再把表征经 adapter 作为前缀接入冻结的 Helios / Wan 2.1 DiT 做视频重建，扩展到 LoRA 微调与少步蒸馏推理，最终搭成重建 + 生成（文生视频、视频编辑）多任务训练。", en: "Moved to continuous representations: a pooling encoder / reverse-pooling decoder trained on frozen Wan VAE latents and aligned to frozen DINOv3 features, then fed through an adapter as a prefix into frozen Helios / Wan 2.1 DiTs for video reconstruction, extended with LoRA tuning and few-step distilled inference, and finally grown into multi-task reconstruction + generation (text-to-video, video editing) training." },
          { labelZh: "训练框架", labelEn: "Training framework", zh: "上述模型训练均基于自研框架 VisionTok-Gen，从零搭建并三次重构：流式 JSONL 数据管线与数据集标准化（OpenVid-1M、Ditto-1M、VideoCoF-50K、ImageNet-1K），按样本生成任务与条件计划的多任务 batch 协议，DeepSpeed 多机训练（最多 48 卡）、EMA、断点续训与多损失梯度冲突分析。", en: "All of the above was trained on VisionTok-Gen, a framework built from scratch and rewritten three times: a streaming JSONL data pipeline with dataset standardization (OpenVid-1M, Ditto-1M, VideoCoF-50K, ImageNet-1K), a multi-task batch contract with per-sample task and condition plans, multi-node DeepSpeed training (up to 48 GPUs), EMA, resumable checkpoints, and per-loss gradient-conflict analysis." },
          { labelZh: "2026.06–07 · 系统层记忆", labelEn: "2026.06–07 · System-level memory", zh: "从改造生成器内部转向冻结生成器、在系统层管理记忆：搭建长视频生产系统 Montage，把剧本拆解为角色、道具、地点等资产，由规划决定每段该继承哪些身份、动作与世界状态，并明确排除已过时的机位、构图与状态；接入 Wan、SVI 等生成后端做长视频实验。", en: "Shifted from modifying generator internals to keeping generators frozen and managing memory at the system level: built Montage, a long-video production system that decomposes a screenplay into character, prop and location assets, where planning decides which identities, motion and world state each segment inherits and explicitly excludes outdated camera setups, compositions and states; ran long-video experiments on Wan, SVI and other backends." },
          { labelZh: "2026.07–08 · MemStrata 算法", labelEn: "2026.07–08 · MemStrata method", zh: "构建 MemStrata，把长视频记忆形式化为“意图到记忆的落地”：同步维护生成时间线、带生命周期状态的实体身份档案、有预算上限的可直接用于生成的视觉证据三层记忆；每段生成前先解读意图（名字可匹配时走零模型调用的快路径，未命中才升级到 MLLM 规划的慢路径），组合出最小而充分的参考上下文，无需全历史检索；生成后对点名实体定向取证、对新出现的实体自我发现，经 VLM 身份核验后按生命周期回写（重认、冲突淘汰、预算裁剪）。在电影数据上以 <strong>2.89</strong> 张参考图取得最佳 F1 0.682（检索基线需 13.8–15.5 张，F1 0.645）；闭环生成中 F1 <strong>0.787</strong>、角色 / 道具召回 0.681，显著高于与生成器耦合的基线（F1 0.45–0.51、召回 ≤ 0.36）。", en: "Built MemStrata, which frames long-video memory as intent-to-memory grounding. It keeps three synchronized strata—a generation timeline, entity identity records with lifecycle state, and budget-bounded generator-ready visual evidence. Before each segment it interprets the intent (a zero-model-call fast path when names match, escalating to MLLM planning only on a miss) and composes a minimal yet sufficient reference context without full-history search; afterwards it acquires evidence for requested entities, self-discovers new ones, verifies identity with a VLM, and writes back with lifecycle awareness (re-identification, conflict deprecation, budget trimming). On films it reaches the best F1 of 0.682 with <strong>2.89</strong> references (retrieval baselines need 13.8–15.5 for 0.645); in closed-loop generation it reaches F1 <strong>0.787</strong> and character/prop recall of 0.681, well above generator-coupled baselines (F1 0.45–0.51, recall ≤ 0.36)." },
          { labelZh: "<a href=\"https://suchenl.github.io/VMem-Bench/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">VMem-Bench</a>（第一作者）", labelEn: "<a href=\"https://suchenl.github.io/VMem-Bench/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">VMem-Bench</a> (first author)", zh: "与 MemStrata 同步设计的双轨评测，把记忆决策与生成质量解耦：在 92 部电影的 16,548 个片段与 30 个故事的 2,824 个生成片段上受控评测，发现检索记忆将实体召回率由 0.559 提升至 0.628–0.693，却使禁入实体规避率由 0.968 降至 0.845–0.898，即<strong>“记住过去不等于理解现在”</strong>。", en: "A two-track benchmark co-designed with MemStrata that separates memory decisions from synthesis quality. A controlled study over 16,548 segments from 92 films and 2,824 generated segments from 30 stories: retrieval raises entity recall from 0.559 to 0.628–0.693 but lowers forbidden-entity avoidance from 0.968 to 0.845–0.898—<strong>remembering the past is not the same as respecting the present</strong>." },
          { labelZh: "开源", labelEn: "Open source", zh: "<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.35001\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">论文</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/Suchenl/VMem-Bench\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">代码</a> · <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/Suchenl/VMem-Bench\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">数据集</a>", en: "<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.35001\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Paper</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/Suchenl/VMem-Bench\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Code</a> · <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/Suchenl/VMem-Bench\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dataset</a>" },
